147d95fd3ca947ba478872debe1d 3x"}, "body": "あなたの絵は素敵ですね。私のキャラクターを描いてもらえませんか？\n\n彼女の名前はテーナで、獰猛で情熱的な人物なのですが、第一印象では冷たく思われがちです。彼女は自分の興味にとても集中していて、強烈なまなざしを持っています。とても自由奔放で、負けず嫌いな性格です。\n\n構図はお任せしたい。できれば白いピストルを持たせてください。衣装はどれでも構いません、自由にお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1RxDKIubhO4SzZQt5apLXbshgAxz-RRNg", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@02wor1d/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 205668, "client_id": 417050, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f52474bb25b541983c9caadf5cc1b2c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f52474bb25b541983c9caadf5cc1b2c, https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fc976cb723403af33ac6a9c9a472966 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ace5f4174eb869944866e0c0111d8c6d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1d06cbc0d817aec2152cc524f2ff824", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1d06cbc0d817aec2152cc524f2ff824, https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=31d2bc79ab2c4442bcdc8d805f87046d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b40c0716/uploads/origins/593b621d-d1f4-4be2-8d2e-b5c0ec9dcc52?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4ad5d943019e803250bce421e4f51395 3x"}, "body": "It's nice to meet you. I saw your paintings a while ago and have been waiting for you to open requests. \n\nI would love to see you draw an OC designed by my friend. He is kind of like a mascot for our friend group and our shared Discord server. His concept is that he is an animation runner for a small animation studio. \n\nI trust your judgement as an artist, please draw whatever pose feels most appropriate.  \n\nBoth you and your art seem very fashionable on twitter. If possible I would like to see Jank dressed in a new outfit. This is optional. \n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://imgchest.com/p/6eyr852qx7p", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@02wor1d/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 205668, "client_id": 2852602, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/77c6e5c0/uploads/origins/c34aabf5-0aa8-4390-a071-b699165e7ddc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6481d5cc4908ec0a52570ac8e046a633", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/77c6e5c0/uploads/origins/c34aabf5-0aa8-4390-a071-b699165e7ddc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6481d5cc4908ec0a52570ac8e046a633, https://si.imgix.net/77c6e5c0/uploads/origins/c34aabf5-0aa8-4390-a071-b699165e7ddc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26bcad2a714bda531131126ced472f4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/77c6e5c0/uploads/origins/c34aabf5-0aa8-4390-a071-b699165e7ddc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&